{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42796","headline":"郡楼闲望书怀 · 刘兼","name":"郡楼闲望书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡城楼阁绕江滨，风物清秋入望频。\n铜鼓祭龙云塞庙，芦花飘市雪黏人。\n莲披净沼羣香散，鹭点寒烟玉片新。\n归去杜陵池馆在，且将朝服拂埃尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}